近，保持在熊猫面部、爪子和蓝色面板之间，突出它破解过程中的细微动作与表情变化。\n\noverall_soundscape: 昏暗舱室内有低沉的设备嗡鸣和轻微金属回响，蓝色面板发出细密的电子提示音，爪子点按时伴随清脆的轻响，熊猫呼吸声短促而克制。\n\nnon_diegetic_music: 低沉的合成器持续音以缓慢节奏铺底，加入稀疏的电子脉冲点，音量轻微增强后在结尾迅速收束。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 291, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 154, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [296, 297], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-3602.4453125, 3476.040283203125], "widgets_values": ["熊猫在破解密码，它自言自语说：还差一点，就成功了"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "Text"}, "name": "Text", "label": "Text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "Text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 149, "type": "DF_Text_Box", "title": "提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DF_Text_Box"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video_url", "label": "video_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_url"}, {"name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "size": [314, 442.8312072753906], "pos": [-2556.965087890625, 3240.33740234375], "widgets_values": ["video/MiniMax_H3", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 287, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "format"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "codec"}], "flags": {}, "id": 92, "type": "SaveVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unco